# SSH into the production host. Copy to deploy/ssh_config (gitignored) and
# fill in: which machine serves production, and how to reach it, stays out of
# the repository (docs/DEPLOY.md §0). deploy/server.sh connects to the Host
# that MURFULU_SSH_HOST in deploy/host.env names.
#
# If another project already reaches the same machine, reuse its Host alias,
# so both share one known_hosts entry.
#
# The current host is Ubuntu in WSL. WSL runs in mirrored networking mode; a
# Hyper-V firewall rule admits port 22 from the local network only. Key auth
# only. Port 22, not 2222: Windows reserves random port ranges at boot and once
# took 2222 — ports below 1024 are never in the dynamic range, so 22 stays free.
Host murfulu-prod
  HostName 203.0.113.10
  Port 22
  User root
  StrictHostKeyChecking accept-new
  ServerAliveInterval 30
